* RSpice functional parts.
*
* Each subcircuit here is a part placed from the Component shelf. They are
* written on the native special-function devices (OTA, BUF, AND, OR, XOR,
* SCHMITT, SRFLOP, COUNTER, PHASEDET, SAMPLEHOLD) and resolve by name with
* no include. Pin order and parameter names are the placement contract the
* schematic binds: change them only together with the part's descriptor.
*
* Internal stages that carry no supply current of their own are referenced to
* the global ground, so a part's supply pins carry its quiescent current and
* the current its output delivers, and nothing else. An output's current is
* steered to the positive supply pin while sourced and to the negative one
* while sunk by a split that is smooth through zero (a 1 nA knee), which keeps
* Newton away from the corner a hard max() would put there.

* Op-amp. Pins: IN+ IN- V+ V- OUT.
* A single-pole voltage-feedback amplifier: a transconductance stage driving
* a 100 pF compensation node sets GBW and AVOL, its current limit sets the
* slew rate, the node is clamped inside the supply pins by HEADROOM, and a
* current-limited output stage of resistance ROUT drives OUT. Output current
* is drawn from V+ when sourced and returned to V- when sunk. The only noise
* is the input noise EN and IN describe.
.subckt RSPICE_FN_OPAMP INP INN VP VN OUT
+ AVOL=200k GBW=10Meg SLEW=10Meg VOS=0 IB=0 IOS=0 RIN=1T CIN=2p
+ EN=10n ENK=100 IN=1f INK=0 ROUT=50 ISRC=25m ISNK=25m HEADROOM=0 IQ=1m
VOS NP INP {VOS}
IBP INP VN {IB+IOS/2}
IBN INN VN {IB-IOS/2}
RIN NP INN {RIN}
CIN NP INN {CIN}
A1 INN NP 0 0 0 0 NC 0 OTA G={2*pi*GBW*100p} IOUT={SLEW*100p} VHIGH=1e9 VLOW=-1e9
+ EN={EN} ENK={ENK} IN={IN} INK={INK}
RC NC 0 {AVOL/(2*pi*GBW*100p)} NOISY=0
CC NC 0 100p
EHI NXH 0 VP 0 1
VHI NXH NHI {HEADROOM}
ELO NXL 0 VN 0 1
VLO NLO NXL {HEADROOM}
A2 NHI NHI NHI NHI NHI NHI NC NHI OTA G=0 LINEAR VHIGH=0 VLOW=-1e9 RCLAMP=1m
A3 NLO NLO NLO NLO NLO NLO NC NLO OTA G=0 LINEAR VHIGH=1e9 VLOW=0 RCLAMP=1m
A4 OUT NC 0 0 0 0 NO 0 OTA G={1/ROUT} IOUT={ISRC} ISINK={-ISNK} ASYM VHIGH=1e9 VLOW=-1e9
VSNS NO OUT 0
BSRC VP 0 I=0.5*(I(VSNS)+sqrt(I(VSNS)*I(VSNS)+1e-18))
BSNK 0 VN I=0.5*(sqrt(I(VSNS)*I(VSNS)+1e-18)-I(VSNS))
IQ VP VN {IQ}
.ends RSPICE_FN_OPAMP

* Comparator. Pins: IN+ IN- V+ V- OUT.
* A differential Schmitt trigger decides; it trips HYST/2 either side of
* -VOS and changes state TPD after its input crosses, and the output edge
* then takes TRISE or TFALL to cross the full swing. The decision drives a
* push-pull stage that swings between the supply pins behind ROUT, or, with
* OC=1, an open-collector stage that only sinks toward V-.
.subckt RSPICE_FN_COMPARATOR INP INN VP VN OUT
+ VOS=0 HYST=1m TPD=100n TRISE=10n TFALL=10n OC=0 ROUT=50 ISRC=20m ISNK=20m IQ=500u
A1 INP INN 0 0 0 NLB NL 0 SCHMITT VT={-VOS} VH={HYST/2} VHIGH=1 VLOW=0 TD={TPD}
+ TRISE={TRISE} TFALL={TFALL}
EVN NVN 0 VN 0 1
A2 0 NL VP VN NVN NVN NT NVN OTA G=1 LINEAR VHIGH=1e9 VLOW=-1e9
RT NT NVN 1 NOISY=0
VPP NPP 0 {1-OC}
A3 OUT NT NPP 0 0 0 NO 0 OTA G={1/ROUT} IOUT={ISRC} ISINK={-ISNK} ASYM VHIGH=1e9 VLOW=-1e9
EOC NOC 0 NLB 0 {OC}
A4 OUT VN NOC 0 0 0 NO 0 OTA G={1/ROUT} IOUT={ISNK} ISINK={-ISNK} VHIGH=1e9 VLOW=-1e9
VSNS NO OUT 0
BSRC VP 0 I=0.5*(I(VSNS)+sqrt(I(VSNS)*I(VSNS)+1e-18))
BSNK 0 VN I=0.5*(sqrt(I(VSNS)*I(VSNS)+1e-18)-I(VSNS))
IQ VP VN {IQ}
.ends RSPICE_FN_COMPARATOR

* Operational transconductance amplifier. Pins: IN+ IN- IABC V+ V- OUT.
* The current into IABC biases a differential pair: the output current is
* IABC*tanh((V(IN+)-V(IN-)+VOS)/VLIN), so the transconductance is IABC/VLIN
* and the output saturates at +-IABC. IABC sits 0.65 V above V-, rising 10 mV
* per mA beyond that, and takes no current below it. The output is a current
* loaded by ROUT and COUT, held HEADROOM inside the supply pins.
.subckt RSPICE_FN_OTA INP INN IABC VP VN OUT
+ VLIN=51.7m VOS=0 ROUT=10Meg COUT=5p HEADROOM=1 IQ=1m
VOS NP INP {VOS}
VIA IABC NIA 0
A0 VN VN VN VN VN VN NIA VN OTA G=0 LINEAR VHIGH=0.65 VLOW=-1e9 RCLAMP=10
FIA 0 NIB VIA 1
RIB NIB 0 1 NOISY=0
A1 INN NP 0 0 0 0 NTH 0 OTA G={1/VLIN} IOUT=1 ISINK=-1 VHIGH=1e9 VLOW=-1e9
RTH NTH 0 1 NOISY=0
A2 0 NTH NIB 0 0 0 NO 0 OTA G=1 LINEAR VHIGH=1e9 VLOW=-1e9
VSNS NO OUT 0
ROUT OUT 0 {ROUT}
COUT OUT 0 {COUT}
EHI NXH 0 VP 0 1
VHI NXH NHI {HEADROOM}
ELO NXL 0 VN 0 1
VLO NLO NXL {HEADROOM}
A3 NHI NHI NHI NHI NHI NHI OUT NHI OTA G=0 LINEAR VHIGH=0 VLOW=-1e9 RCLAMP=1
A4 NLO NLO NLO NLO NLO NLO OUT NLO OTA G=0 LINEAR VHIGH=1e9 VLOW=0 RCLAMP=1
BSRC VP 0 I=0.5*(I(VSNS)+sqrt(I(VSNS)*I(VSNS)+1e-18))
BSNK 0 VN I=0.5*(sqrt(I(VSNS)*I(VSNS)+1e-18)-I(VSNS))
IQ VP VN {IQ}
.ends RSPICE_FN_OTA
